{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the metroidvania MARS 2120, you are sent on a rescue mission to Earth's first colony on Mars. Something terrible has happened, and it's up to you to uncover the truth. Combining intense melee combat, action-packed shootouts, and elemental special abilities, you'll need to explore hostile environments, face relentless enemies, and uncover the secrets of a threat that may extend far beyond the red planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the \u201cThe More, The Merrier\u201d DLC, the journey becomes even more challenging.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now with the long-awaited option to reconfigure controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two new game modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+</strong> - Relive the campaign while keeping your upgrades, but face stronger and more lethal enemies and bosses (health and damage increased by 1.5x).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game++</strong> - For the most fearless, an even greater challenge: enemies and bosses with double health and damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New achievements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new game mode brings exclusive achievements to reward only the most skilled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to return to Mars, test your limits, and prove that you can master every battle. After all, the harder... the better.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802560?t=1760721033","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3802560?t=1760721033","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802560/4a43435515aa9dce43c286d4d99fb8f9ca759a8a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760721033","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3802560/4a43435515aa9dce43c286d4d99fb8f9ca759a8a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760721033","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Downloadable Content","id":21},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the metroidvania MARS 2120, you are sent on a rescue mission to Earth's first colony on Mars. Something terrible has happened, and it's up to you to uncover the truth. Combining intense melee combat, action-packed shootouts, and elemental special abilities, you'll need to explore hostile environments, face relentless enemies, and uncover the secrets of a threat that may extend far beyond the red planet.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>With the \u201cThe More, The Merrier\u201d DLC, the journey becomes even more challenging.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play your way</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now with the long-awaited option to reconfigure controls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Two new game modes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game+</strong> - Relive the campaign while keeping your upgrades, but face stronger and more lethal enemies and bosses (health and damage increased by 1.5x).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Game++</strong> - For the most fearless, an even greater challenge: enemies and bosses with double health and damage.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>New achievements</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each new game mode brings exclusive achievements to reward only the most skilled.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Get ready to return to Mars, test your limits, and prove that you can master every battle. After all, the harder... the bet